    "detailed_description": "tranceWave NEO is a classic arcade twin-stick shmup, inspired by others in the &quot;trance shooter&quot; genre.  Move, shoot, survive, and aim for a high score!  Waves of enemies will continually spawn, and you must eliminate them before they eliminate you.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe core gameplay is easy to pick up, but aiming for a high score requires focus and strategy.  A full in-game guide is included, which explains everything you will need to know to top the leaderboards.  Good luck!",
